ignore:
  SNYK-JS-NGXBOOTSTRAP-174319:
    - "ngx-bootstrap":
        reason: >-
          The XSS is in the typeahead component, which ZAC does not use. ngx-bootstrap is only a
          required peer dependency of @formio/angular, which imports only ngx-bootstrap/modal and
          ngx-bootstrap/pagination. No fixed version exists.
        expires: 2027-05-09T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z
